<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - STERIS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - STERIS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co analyst Christopher Caton raised his rating for STERIS Corp Wednesday to aggressive buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although we are lowering our FY 1998 (EPS) estimate to $1.95 (previously $2.02), we believe earnings visibility and predictability is much improved and the stock should be able to sustain a P/E ratio more reflective on its long-term growth rate of 25 percent,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our new FY1Q estimate is $0.33 per share vs $0.28 and our FY 1999 estimate is $2.30 per share.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Mentor, Ohio, infection prevention systems company were up 1-3/4 to 30-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
